  m_text: '<b>Aldric the Wanderer</b>

    Once a scribe of the northern abbey, Aldric
    left with a stolen map and a borrowed dagger. The roads have been kind to him.
    The taverns, less so.


    <i>Toggle these pages with the tabs above.</i>'
